          "text": "The user wants to run EXCLURAD for eta at W=2.0, Q2=3.0 with 2.2 GeV beam. I need to check what's physically possible.\n\nFirst, let me list channels and check preflight conditions for eta. I also need to know beam energy access constraints.",
